(text "REED rev 0.7. Two modes, one isolator, one isolated 3.3 V rail. REED_RET is not GND, UP_RET, DN_RET or GND_CAN.\\nJP_REED is a 2.54 mm 1x03 header. Copper does not join the pins. SH_REED is the loose shunt, default on pins 1-2.\\nPin 2 is REED_ISO. Pin 1 is LOFRANS_NODE. Pin 3 is DRY_A. The 4.7k pull-up is on DRY_A only.\\nMEJ2S0503SC is 5 V to 3.3 V. A 51 ohm preload is about 65 mA, above 10 percent of the 606 mA rating, so the published load envelope applies.\\nISO7721 field supply is 3.3 V on purpose. At 5 V, VIH would be 3.5 V and the measured 3.22 V idle would not be a reliable high." (at 20 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "a4202299-e4e7-407d-ba1c-a4663d9340b0"))
(symbol
  (lib_id "windlass:MEJ2S")
  (at 39.37 180.34 0)
  (unit 1)
